	"Name": "Pride Giant Tamagotchi Egg TVs",
	"Author": "Asterisk555",
	"TagLine": "Retextures the budget TV so it looks like a giant tamagotchi",
	"Description": "_Description:_\n\n*   Retextures the budget TV so it looks like a giant tamagotchi\n\n*   Config to retexture the TV channels so they all match the LCD display\n\n*   PC and Mobile compatible\n\n*   If you like this check out my other mods! I also do commissions and have a [Kofi](https://ko-fi.com/asteriskart)\n_Quick start_\n\n1.  For the Content Patcher version you need version   1.19 of [CP](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915)  or higher\n\n2.  Extract this mod and it's required mods into your mods folder (if you are confused check out [this guide](https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Player_Guide/Getting_Started#Getting_started) )\n\n3.  It's ready to play!\n_Config guide_\n\n*   'true' will retexture the TV channels so they look like they've on a green LCD screen, 'false' will disable this feature\n\n*   Next to 'Design' type the number of the texture you'd like, which can be found in the assets folder\n_Tips and tricks_\n\n*   Alternative Textures conversion is also bundled into my [Big Interior Mod](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10400), so if you have the furniture pack from that mod you don't need this one\n\n*   Use [this mod](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11781)  to have the TV take up less floor space",
